{"3871040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BallShot Arena", "steam_appid": 3871040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras/b95a85bc42355166fb08bf9073f426f4.poster.avif?t=1784098313\" width=844 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras/b95a85bc42355166fb08bf9073f426f4.webm?t=1784098313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras/b95a85bc42355166fb08bf9073f426f4.mp4?t=1784098313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>BallShot Arena reimagines competitive multiplayer by blending the strategy of sports games with the precision of shooters, without player damage.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision Physics-Driven Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Football and Tennis Reimagined</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Loadouts and Creative Playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive Multiplayer Matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory Road Progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for Spectatorship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PRECISION PHYSICS-DRIVEN GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every play is entirely skill-based</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras/3e04161dac3519619fc111fdb06c37d1.poster.avif?t=1784098313\" width=844 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras/3e04161dac3519619fc111fdb06c37d1.webm?t=1784098313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras/3e04161dac3519619fc111fdb06c37d1.mp4?t=1784098313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BallShot Arena is built around physics-driven gameplay where angles, timing, positioning, and mechanical precision determine every outcome. There’s no randomness, no lucky hits, and no hidden advantages ; just pure control, fast reactions, and smart decision-making.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FOOTBALL AND TENNIS REIMAGINED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Same competitive foundation, different sports, and more to come</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras/7cf492f0b64aa8224c59a85ef1ea949f.avif?t=1784098313\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras_big/7cf492f0b64aa8224c59a85ef1ea949f.webp?t=1784098313 width=1560 height=431 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in gameplay modes inspired by football and tennis, each bringing unique pacing, spacing, and tactical possibilities. More sports and new ways to play are planned as BallShot Arena continues to evolve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TACTICAL LOADOUTS AND CREATIVE PLAYSTYLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Create a style that feels uniquely yours</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 